# =====================================================================
#  This folder contains REAL financial data. Default to ignoring
#  EVERYTHING; explicitly permit ONLY the code / docs / bundled assets
#  listed below. Anything not listed stays out of git — every workbook,
#  CSV, TSV, mapping, output, and personal-data folder.
# =====================================================================
*

# --- code & scripts ---
!anonymizer.py
!anonymize.ps1
!RUN_ANONYMIZER.bat
!RUN_ANONYMIZER9.bat
!RUN_BANKS_ONLY.bat

# --- docs & templates (no personal data) ---
!README.md
!CLAUDE.md
